sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant P as PIN Service
    participant T as Transaction Store
    participant Pay as Payment Partner
    C->>P: POST /v1/pins
    P->>T: Create internal_reference, state=pending
    P->>Pay: Charge 350000 kobo + internal_reference
    alt Confirmed
        Pay-->>P: Success + partner_reference
        P->>T: state=charged
        P->>T: Issue one PIN
        P-->>C: 201 + PIN
    else Declined
        Pay-->>P: Declined
        P->>T: state=failed
        P-->>C: 402 declined
    else Timeout
        P->>T: state=unknown
        P->>Pay: Query status by internal_reference
        alt Now confirmed
            Pay-->>P: Charged
            P->>T: Issue one PIN only if none exists yet
            P-->>C: Confirmed + PIN
        else Still unknown
            P-->>C: Status unclear — do not retry with same card
        end
    end
